{"results":[{"url":"https://www.facebook.com/kausarmohiuddinkarwan/videos/special-hmwssb-team-deployed-in-karwan-constituency-for-door-to-door-distributio/718146167632886/","final_url":"https://www.facebook.com/kausarmohiuddinkarwan/videos/special-hmwssb-team-deployed-in-karwan-constituency-for-door-to-door-distributio/718146167632886/","title":"8.4K views · 396 reactions | Special HMWSSB Team Deployed in Karwan Constituency for Door-to-Door Distribution of Chlorine Tablets\n\nIn response to the recent surge in waterborne illnesses in the Karwan constituency, a special seven member team from the Hyderabad Metropolitan Water Supply and Sewerage Board (HMWSSB) has been deployed on an urgent basis. The move comes after complaints were received regarding contaminated drinking water leading to cases of vomiting, stomach pain, and other health concerns, particularly in areas served by Shaikpet and Allah Banda reservoirs. | Kausar Mohiuddin","description":"Special HMWSSB Team Deployed in Karwan Constituency for Door-to-Door Distribution of Chlorine Tablets\n\nIn response to the recent surge in waterborne illnesses in the Karwan constituency, a special...","language":"en","text":"Mohhmadfiroj Ali\n\nशाहिद बदरुद्दीनतैयब्जी बैरिस्टर शाहिद बदरुद्दीन तैयब जी बैरिस्टर मुंबई हाई कोर्ट चीफ जस्टिस मां हम उनकी सिपाही।। बदरुद्दीन तैयब जी की फैमिली शुरुआत की भारत की झंडा की डिजाइन दिया असदुद्दीन ओवैसी सिपाही आप किसी पार्टी के गुलामी नहीं करेगा तीन परसेंट ब्र…\n\nSee more\n\n* 1y","author":null,"published_date":null,"latency_ms":2018.1775410019327,"format":"markdown"}],"errors":[]}